       "source": "The Guardian World",
       "via": null
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The ECB has not signalled a decision for December; Christine Lagarde says incoming data will determine whether a rate rise is needed.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "key": "c4cc176be6bbddde",
       "title": "ECB's Lagarde says data will tell if December rate hike needed - AOL.com",
