       "source": "AOL.com",
       "via": "Google News"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The Bank of England raised its policy rate to 4% and signalled a further increase may follow as it tackles inflation.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "key": "bad87b539115be2f",
       "title": "Bank of England raises interest rates to 4%, the first increase for more than three years",
       "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/nov/05/bank-of-england-raises-interest-rates-first-increase-for-more-than-three-years",
       "source": "The Guardian World",
       "via": null
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Large demonstrations over the cost of living drew an estimated 600,000 people across France, according to the interior ministry; unions put the turnout higher.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "key": "ba26403f95e15c7c",
       "title": "French protests see numbers surge as unions join strikes over high cost of living",
