       "source": "BBC World",
       "via": null
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Bomb threats disrupted at least 22 flights across Europe, prompting emergency landings and diversions and renewed concern about hybrid threats.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "key": "155e203a7518751b",
       "title": "Bomb threats disrupt at least 22 flights across Europe, raising hybrid war fears",
